#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_below_cost
msgid ""
"A price or a discount that sells a product for less than its cost is "
"refused."
msgstr "Un prix ou une remise qui vend un produit sous son coût est refusé."

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model,name:om_access_manager_pos.model_om_access_profile
msgid "Access Profile"
msgstr "Profil d'accès"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_close
msgid ""
"Close Register is hidden from the menu of the Point of Sale, and closing "
"sent anyway is refused."
msgstr ""
"« Fermer la caisse » est masqué du menu du Point de Vente, et une clôture "
"envoyée malgré tout est refusée."

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_access_manager_pos
msgid ""
"Completely free. Adds the Point of Sale restrictions of POS Access Control "
"to the access profiles of the User Access Manager: every cashier of a "
"profile gets them."
msgstr ""
"Entièrement gratuit. Ajoute les restrictions du Contrôle d'accès PdV aux "
"profils d'accès du User Access Manager : chaque caissier d'un profil les "
"reçoit."

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_partner_edit
msgid ""
"Create and Edit are hidden from the customers of the Point of Sale, and "
"saving a customer from it is refused. Choosing a customer stays possible."
msgstr ""
"« Créer » et « Modifier » sont masqués des clients du Point de Vente, et "
"enregistrer un client depuis celui-ci est refusé. Choisir un client reste "
"possible."

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_access_manager_pos.om_access_profile_view_form_pos
msgid "Customers and Lines"
msgstr "Clients et lignes"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_access_manager_pos.om_access_profile_view_form_pos
msgid "Discounts and Prices"
msgstr "Remises et prix"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__display_name
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_pos_access__display_name
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "Nom d'affichage"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_access_manager_pos.om_access_profile_view_form_pos
msgid "Every payment method of the shop"
msgstr "Tous les modes de paiement de la boutique"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_om_access_manager_pos
msgid ""
"Restrict what each cashier may do in the Point of Sale, per access profile"
msgstr ""
"Limitez ce que chaque caissier peut faire au Point de Vente, par profil "
"d'accès"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_max_price_cut
msgid ""
"How far below the price of the pricelist a price may be set. 0 for no limit."
msgstr ""
"Jusqu'où un prix peut descendre sous celui de la liste de prix. 0 pour "
"aucune limite."

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_pos_access__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_payment_method_ids
msgid ""
"Leave empty to allow every payment method of the shop. Set, only these are "
"shown and may be used, and orders paid otherwise are refused."
msgstr ""
"Laissez vide pour autoriser tous les modes de paiement de la boutique. "
"Renseigné, seuls ceux-ci sont affichés et utilisables, et les commandes "
"payées autrement sont refusées."

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_max_discount
msgid "Maximum Discount (%)"
msgstr "Remise maximale (%)"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_max_price_cut
msgid "Maximum Price Cut (%)"
msgstr "Baisse de prix maximale (%)"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_below_cost
msgid "Never Below Cost"
msgstr "Jamais sous le coût"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_cash_move
msgid "No Cash In or Out"
msgstr "Pas d'entrée ni de sortie d'espèces"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_close
msgid "No Closing the Register"
msgstr "Pas de fermeture de la caisse"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_partner_edit
msgid "No Creating or Editing Customers"
msgstr "Pas de création ni de modification de clients"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_discount
msgid "No Discounts"
msgstr "Pas de remises"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_price_change
msgid "No Price Changes"
msgstr "Pas de changement de prix"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_refund
msgid "No Refunds"
msgstr "Pas de remboursements"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_decrease
msgid "No Removing Lines or Lowering Quantities"
msgstr "Pas de suppression de lignes ni de baisse des quantités"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_decrease
msgid ""
"Once a product is on the order, it cannot be removed nor its quantity "
"lowered: a manager has to. Checked on the screen of the Point of Sale only: "
"the server only sees the final order."
msgstr ""
"Une fois un produit sur la commande, il ne peut être ni retiré ni sa "
"quantité baissée : un responsable doit le faire. Vérifié sur l'écran du "
"Point de Vente uniquement : le serveur ne voit que la commande finale."

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_payment_method_ids
msgid "Only These Payment Methods"
msgstr "Uniquement ces modes de paiement"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_access_manager_pos.om_access_profile_view_form_pos
msgid "Orders"
msgstr "Commandes"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_access_manager_pos.om_access_profile_view_form_pos
msgid "Payment"
msgstr "Paiement"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_access_manager_pos.om_access_profile_view_form_pos
msgid "Point of Sale"
msgstr "Point de Vente"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model,name:om_access_manager_pos.model_om_pos_access
msgid "Point of Sale Access Control"
msgstr "Contrôle d'accès au Point de Vente"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_access_manager_pos.om_access_profile_view_form_pos
msgid "Register"
msgstr "Caisse"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_cash_move
msgid ""
"The Cash In/Out button of the Point of Sale is hidden, and cash moves sent "
"anyway are refused."
msgstr ""
"Le bouton Entrée/Sortie d'espèces du Point de Vente est masqué, et les "
"mouvements d'espèces envoyés malgré tout sont refusés."

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_refund
msgid ""
"The Refund button of the Point of Sale is hidden, and refunds sent anyway "
"are refused."
msgstr ""
"Le bouton Rembourser du Point de Vente est masqué, et les remboursements "
"envoyés malgré tout sont refusés."

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_discount
msgid ""
"The discount key (%) of the Point of Sale is disabled, and orders sent with "
"a discounted line, or with the global discount, are refused. Refunding a "
"discounted sale stays possible."
msgstr ""
"La touche remise (%) du Point de Vente est désactivée, et les commandes "
"envoyées avec une ligne remisée, ou avec la remise globale, sont refusées. "
"Rembourser une vente remisée reste possible."

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_max_discount
msgid "The highest discount that may be given on a line. 0 for no limit."
msgstr ""
"La remise la plus élevée pouvant être accordée sur une ligne. 0 pour aucune "
"limite."

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_price_change
msgid ""
"The price key of the Point of Sale is disabled, and a price below the one of"
" the pricelist is refused."
msgstr ""
"La touche prix du Point de Vente est désactivée, et un prix inférieur à "
"celui de la liste de prix est refusé."

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_om_access_manager_pos
msgid "User Access Manager for Point of Sale"
msgstr "User Access Manager pour le Point de Vente"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_access_manager_pos.om_access_profile_view_form_pos
msgid ""
"What the cashiers of this profile may not do in the Point of Sale. A cashier is\n"
"                        an Odoo user of the profile, or a POS employee listed below when employees log in\n"
"                        to the shop. Rules set on the user or the employee themselves apply too: the\n"
"                        strictest wins."
msgstr ""
"Ce que les caissiers de ce profil ne peuvent pas faire au Point de Vente. Un"
" caissier est un utilisateur Odoo du profil, ou un employé PdV listé ci-"
"dessous lorsque les employés se connectent à la boutique. Les règles "
"définies sur l'utilisateur ou l'employé lui-même s'appliquent aussi : la "
"plus stricte l'emporte."

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_refund_receipt_only
msgid ""
"A refund goes through Orders, from the receipt of the sale: a line made "
"negative with the +/- key is refused."
msgstr ""
"Un remboursement passe par Commandes, depuis le ticket de la vente : une "
"ligne rendue négative avec la touche +/- est refusée."

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_cancel
msgid ""
"Cancel Order is hidden, an order with products cannot be deleted from the "
"list of orders, and cancelling an order sent anyway is refused."
msgstr ""
"Annuler la commande est masqué, une commande avec des produits ne peut pas "
"être supprimée de la liste des commandes, et l'annulation d'une commande "
"envoyée malgré tout est refusée."

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:om_access_manager_pos.om_access_profile_view_form_pos
msgid "Every pricelist of the shop"
msgstr "Toutes les listes de prix de la boutique"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_pricelist_ids
msgid ""
"Leave empty to allow every pricelist of the shop. Set, only these can be "
"chosen, and orders with another pricelist are refused: the price and "
"discount limits are measured against them."
msgstr ""
"Laissez vide pour autoriser toutes les listes de prix de la boutique. "
"Renseigné, seules celles-ci peuvent être choisies, et les commandes avec une"
" autre liste de prix sont refusées : les limites de prix et de remise se "
"mesurent par rapport à elles."

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_max_refund
msgid "Maximum Refund"
msgstr "Remboursement maximal"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_no_cancel
msgid "No Cancelling Orders"
msgstr "Pas d'annulation de commandes"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_pricelist_ids
msgid "Only These Pricelists"
msgstr "Uniquement ces listes de prix"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_refund_receipt_only
msgid "Refunds Only From a Receipt"
msgstr "Remboursements uniquement depuis un ticket"

#. module: om_access_manager_pos
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:om_access_manager_pos.field_om_access_profile__om_pos_max_refund
msgid ""
"The highest amount, taxes included, an order may give back, in the currency "
"of the shop. 0 for no limit."
msgstr ""
"Le montant le plus élevé, taxes comprises, qu'une commande peut rendre, dans"
" la devise de la boutique. 0 pour aucune limite."
